      "message": "Not this patch, but noting since it got me looking. Are we missing a state...? And doing things out-of-order?\n\nWhere is (PE_PRS_SRC_SNK_Assert_Rd State)? And shouldn\u0027t it come /after/ we turn off VBUS?\n\nSee (Figure 8-116: Dual-Role Port in Source to Sink Power Role Swap State Diagram). This should be in \"entry\" of hypothetical (pe_prs_src_snk_assert_rd), not entry to (pe_prs_src_snk_transition_to_off).\n\nApplying Rd before removing VBUS may break some USB-IF Compliant partner peripheral state machines.",
      "range": {
